5. Datasets & Identifier Mappings
---------------------------------

- Release-group name data: derived from https://github.com/filebot/data under
  CC0 1.0. Notice retained in assets/licenses/filebot-data.txt; the generated
  lookup contains literal names only and does not execute upstream expressions.
- Bangumi-to-TMDB identifier mappings: derived from Wikidata (properties P5732,
  P4983, and P4947) under CC0 1.0 and open-ani/bangumi-tmdb
  (https://github.com/open-ani/bangumi-tmdb) under CC BY 4.0. Notices are
  retained in assets/licenses/wikidata-cc0.txt and
  assets/licenses/open-ani-bangumi-tmdb-cc-by-4.0.txt. The compiled binary
  lookup contains numeric identifiers and optional season numbers only and is
  used as a matching signal, never as a sole binding decision.
- TVDB identifier enrichment for v2 mapping snapshots: derived via
  tool/import_bangumi_tmdb_map.py from Fribb/anime-lists
  (https://github.com/Fribb/anime-lists) for numeric ID cross-referencing only.
- Bangumi Archive: optionally downloaded or imported at the user's request; its
  snapshot and generated database are not bundled in this repository or release
  packages.
